  "summary": "Malicious code in vl-ui-cookie-consent (npm)",
  "details": "Vl-ui-cookie-consent is a combosquat package whose name mimics the vl-ui UI-component library family. The package ships no functional code: a single 55-byte comment-only index.js and empty lifecycle hooks, with no dependencies, no network behaviour, and no exfiltration in this version. It appears to be a placeholder/reserved name in a namespace-impersonation campaign rather than a functional library.",
